---
// Hidden campaign landing page - "Safe Filling Replacement" video from Dr. Jill
// Intentionally not in navigation, not in sitemap.xml, and set to noindex.
// URL: /safe-filling-replacement
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="A Note from Dr. Jill About Your Silver Fillings"
  description="Dr. Jill on safely replacing older mercury amalgam fillings using the SMART protocol at Central Dentist Dallas."
  ogImage="/videos/dr-jill-mercury-fillings.jpg"
  canonicalURL="https://www.centraldentist.com/safe-filling-replacement"
  noindex={true}
  schemaType="WebPage"
>
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

        <!-- Heading -->
        <div class="text-center mb-8">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-medium text-white mb-4"
                style="background: linear-gradient(to right, #0099ba, #006786);">
            A message for our patients
          </span>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-normal mb-4"
              style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; color: #006786;">
            A Personal Note from Dr. Jill About Your Silver Fillings
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg" style="color: #4b5563; font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;">
            Why we may suggest replacing older mercury amalgam fillings, and how we do it safely.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Video (portrait - constrain by height so it fits the viewport, then center) -->
        <div class="mb-8 flex justify-center">
          <div class="relative inline-block leading-none">
            <video
              id="mercury-video"
              class="block rounded-2xl shadow-lg bg-black"
              style="width: min(360px, 92vw); height: auto;"
              controls
              playsinline
              preload="metadata"
              poster="/videos/dr-jill-mercury-fillings.jpg"
            >
              <source src="/videos/dr-jill-mercury-fillings.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
              <track
                kind="captions"
                src="/videos/dr-jill-mercury-fillings.vtt"
                srclang="en"
                label="English"
                default
              />
              Your browser does not support embedded video.
              <a href="/videos/dr-jill-mercury-fillings.mp4">Download the video instead.</a>
            </video>
            <!-- Custom play-button overlay (hidden once playback starts) -->
            <button
              type="button"
              id="mercury-video-play"
              aria-label="Play video"
              class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl cursor-pointer group focus:outline-none"
              style="background: rgba(0, 40, 55, 0.18);"
            >
              <span
                class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full shadow-xl transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:scale-110"
                style="width: 88px; height: 88px; background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #0099ba, #006786);"
              >
                <svg class="w-9 h-9 ml-1 text-white" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" />
                </svg>
              </span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <script is:inline>
          (function () {
            var v = document.getElementById('mercury-video');
            var btn = document.getElementById('mercury-video-play');
            if (!v || !btn) return;
            btn.addEventListener('click', function () { v.play(); });
            v.addEventListener('play', function () { btn.style.display = 'none'; });
          })();
        </script>

        <!-- Body copy -->
        <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 space-y-4">
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color: #4b5563; font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;">
            Silver fillings, also called amalgam, contain mercury. An intact filling does not automatically
            mean it is causing a health problem, but small amounts of mercury vapor can be released over time,
            especially with chewing, grinding, or very hot or very cold drinks. From a biological dentistry
            perspective, our goal is to reduce unnecessary exposure and lower your overall toxic burden. Older
            fillings also crack and age, which can lead to fractures in the tooth around them, so replacing them
            at the right time can prevent bigger problems later.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color: #4b5563; font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;">
            If you choose to have them replaced, we use the SMART protocol (Safe Mercury Amalgam Removal
            Technique), with special isolation, high-volume suction, air filtration, and other protective steps
            designed to minimize mercury exposure during the procedure. We can start with the fillings that are
            largest, oldest, or showing signs of wear, and build a plan that feels manageable for you.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA buttons -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="px-8 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#a6b443] to-[#c7cd85] text-white rounded-full font-semibold transition-all duration-300 hover:from-[#8fa339] hover:to-[#a6b443] hover:shadow-lg inline-flex items-center justify-center"
            style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;"
          >
            Schedule a Consultation
          </a>
          <a
            href="tel:214-368-0900"
            class="px-8 py-3 bg-white border-2 rounded-full font-semibold transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg inline-flex items-center justify-center"
            style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; color: #0099ba; border-color: #0099ba;"
            onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#006786'; this.style.color='white'; this.style.borderColor='#006786';"
            onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='white'; this.style.color='#0099ba'; this.style.borderColor='#0099ba';"
          >
            <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="mr-2 w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
            </svg>
            Call (214) 368-0900
          </a>
          <a
            href="/services/mercury-free-approach"
            class="px-8 py-3 bg-white border-2 rounded-full font-semibold transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg inline-flex items-center justify-center"
            style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; color: #0099ba; border-color: #0099ba;"
            onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#006786'; this.style.color='white'; this.style.borderColor='#006786';"
            onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='white'; this.style.color='#0099ba'; this.style.borderColor='#0099ba';"
          >
            Learn About Our SMART Approach
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
